     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Determine the remainder when 387 is divided by 12.</p>\n<p>387 ÷ 12 = 32 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"12 \\times 32 = 384\"></span></p>\n<p>Subtract 384 from 387.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"387 – 384 = 3\"></span></p>\n<p>The remainder is 3.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 387 mod 12.</p>\n<p>387 mod 12 ≡ 3</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "387 = 3 (mod 12)"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
